## BLOCKERS / NOTES

- No technical D2 blocker remains.
- The two D5 items left open at BUILD are closed by measurement: the test floor
  is now 989, and the Supabase Redirect URLs wildcard
  `https://timely-lokum-43a12e.netlify.app/**` was re-measured on 26 Aug 2026
  and still accepts the query-carrying callback. That wildcard remains a
  dependency: if it were removed, Supabase would fall back to the Site URL in
